  "chapter_readings": [
    {
      "text": "The golden book flaps its pages and lands on Maya’s shoulder. Radiophone speaks up immediately: “This book teaches an important spell. The word is: Reparo! It repairs every broken thing.” Tom takes his old, broken compass out of his pocket. He always has it with him.",
